Probably the worst FC/Fifa there has been. Last 2 were awful too, but I feel the pain is compounding with this game;
 the game is so mudded, powercurve doesnt even exist, womens are so broken, gameplay is torture, meanwhile all the 'content' of the game is store packs or busted evos that take years/infinite money that 90% of the community do on ratty womens or op players just so they can sit in a basement giggling to their all 90 stat cards playing 4-5-1 with no football iq, man marking every passing lane getting the ai to do all the main defending so you have no option, then just pass to pina and also go down the line for cutbacks, 0 football play the entire game, just playing to the rubbish meta.

TLDR; Don't buy unless its min 75% off, which won't be hard to wait for due to the lack of full price sales EA will be achieving with the state of the game. Enjoy!
